Developed user personas to help the client better understand patient motives and behavior. Conducted a competitor analysis to shape an effective strategy in the target market. Planned an editorial calendar to guide when, what, why, and how content was created, maintained, and promoted, to build trust and consistency with the audience.
        <br /><br />
